 "equipment_type": "Chiller (water-cooled, magnetic-bearing centrifugal)",
 "applies_to": "Magnitude WME C- and D-vintage and WME-C QUAD chillers with the MicroTech unit controller and Modbus communication module, per ED 19111-4.",
 "summary": "The Magnitude WME is Daikin Applied's oil-free magnetic-bearing centrifugal chiller. With the Modbus communication module its MicroTech controller exposes all points as 16-bit holding registers. This map covers chiller status and commands, water temperatures and flows, alarm codes, circuit refrigerant values, per-compressor data and pump run hours.",
 "transport": [
  "RTU"
 ],
